description	"The Imperial Commando

This class specializes in short duration, medium range engagements, moving from cover to cover and blasting enemies with powerful but inaccurate rifle salvos. 

^2Weaponry:
- E-11 Blaster Carbine (2)
-- Primary Fire Only
-- 40% Faster RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Light Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 50% Less DMG
-- Mag Reload
- Cortosis Shiv
-- ^5Cyan ^7Style Only

^6Equipment:
- Medpac (25HP+)
- Advanced Medpac (50HP+)
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Force Sense Immunity
- Shield Regeneration (1)
- Blast Armour
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]

^2Strengths^7: Powerful but inaccurate carbine deals high damage at medium-close Range, Carries a Medium Capacity Shield that can fully regenerate.
^1Weaknesses^7: Relatively poor vitality/armor compared to other classes of a similar reinforcement tier."